 Gong Gede (big gong) or Kenong Agung. The sound of this traditional musical instrument can be heard from a distance, so it becomes the signal for various activities that take place at Benteng Chinese Culture Park Semarang to begin their activity. In addition, there are also other types of gongs such as kenong kecil (small kempul), bedug (drum made of brass).


